<Document>
  <name>Iceland · Sep 19–29, 2026</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Ten nights counterclockwise: the south-coast icons and the Katla ice cave, the east fjords, whales and horses at Húsavík, Mývatn, Snæfellsnes, and Into the Glacier on the last full day. One F-road — Road 550 up to Klaki — and the rental is cleared for it.<br><br>Route lines follow roads, generated with OSRM from OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.]]></description>
