    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Siglufjörður</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>09:15–10:30</b><br><br>Harbor + old town via the fjord tunnels. Herring Era Museum often runs afternoon-only September hours — verify the night before.<br><br>◈ The marina with coloured houses stacked under the fjord wall. At 09:15 the sun is only 11° up and half the fjord is still in shadow, which is exactly what makes the lit half worth the frame.]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#stop8</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>-18.9054,66.1512</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hofsós pool</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>11:15–12:15</b> · <i>soak</i><br><br>Fjord-edge infinity swim — confirm Saturday hours; swimsuits in the day bag. Quick lunch after, 12:15–12:45.<br><br>◈ The picture is the infinity edge — the pool's lip dissolving into Skagafjörður with <b>Drangey</b> out on the water beyond. Shoot north with the sun behind you. Phone only, and be quick: people are swimming.]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#stop8</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>-19.4108,65.8965</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Glaumbær turf farm</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>13:20–14:05</b><br><br>Exterior is the show if the museum's on short hours.<br><br>◈ The row of grass-roofed gables end-on, so the turf reads as one wall of green. Better from outside than in.]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#stop8</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>-19.5058,65.6099</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Kolugljúfur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>15:20–15:40</b> · <i>optional</i><br><br>15-min leg stretch off Rte 1, then ~2.5 hrs west — fuel + snack in Borgarnes ~17:10, and the hotel is on Route 54 south of Stykkishólmur, so you pass the turn rather than doubling back.<br><br>◈ Twenty minutes, one frame: the falls stepping through the gorge, taken from the bridge.]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#stop8</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>-20.5732,65.3293</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Night 8 · Stykkishólmur</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Hotel Stundarfriður</b><br>Snæfellsnesvegur, 340 Stykkishólmur — on Route 54, ~8 km south of town]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#base8</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>-22.7297,65.0757</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
  </Folder>
  <Folder>
    <name>Day 9 · Sun Sep 27 · Snæfellsnes, tip to toe</name>
    <description><![CDATA[~280 km · out 08:15 · in 18:15]]></description>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Day 9 leg</name>
      <description><![CDATA[~280 km · 279.8 km by road, about 4.6 hrs driving]]></description>
